    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000000","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"刚到的时候我只能苦笑。看起来就像个到处都是海鸟的巨大鸟巢。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000000","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这里原来是谁的？再破，要建成它也得花不少钱吧。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000000","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"看样子，这座平台是美国一所大学为研究<R=海洋温差发电,OTEC>而建的。锈迹斑斑的发电涡轮上还留着他们的名字。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000000","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"建造时当然也得到过政府和企业援助吧。可最终还是没能解决热效率问题，研究就此中止。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000000","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"而且这座平台还设计成能与同规格的平台<R=对接,JOINT>。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000790","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"新平台采用<R=六边形,HEX>结构。面积比原来的更大，也便于有计划地扩建。能大规模扩张了。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
