    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000790","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"<R=蜂巢,HONEYCOMB>，不是挺好吗？据说蜂巢结构强度很高。我听说连坦克装甲都在考虑采用。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"顺便问一句，谁来当蜂后？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是啊？我觉得是Paz。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这样啊，我倒觉得是Strangelove……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"Cecile或许也算。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
