    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Snake，就这么定吧。我们这里的女性全都是蜂后。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000A80","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"明白。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我知道你已经体验过了，不过还是让我确认一下流程。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"明白。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_CN_EMPTY"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"万无一失。回收用直升机<R=HU-1,HUEY>的挂钩也安装好了……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"通常富尔顿回收要用固定翼飞机。既然有直升机，直接降落接人不是更稳妥吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"听着，Snake，任务中会反复进行回收。我们得尽量降低暴露在敌军火力下的风险。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"所以，能让飞机高速<R=掠过,FLY-BY>并完成回收的富尔顿系统最合适。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":16,"cn_text":"Boss，你差不多该摆脱在军队时的那套想法了。我们和那些能花公款享受的家伙不一样。还是说……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_000D00","unique_index":18,"cn_text":"直升机的反应也更快。方法确实有些特别，但应该不会觉得不方便。你很快就会习惯。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_001700","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，回想一下。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;N_TO_ONE_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_001700","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我们创立的无国界军队……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;N_TO_ONE_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_001700","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"<R=Militaires,MILITAIRES> <R=Sans,SANS> <R=Frontières,FRONTIÈRES>的目标是不受国家和意识形态束缚，为需要的土地和势力提供所需的军事力量。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_001700","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"MSF的徽标以两亿五千万年前的盘古大陆为原型。那是世界仍为一整块大陆的时代。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_001B50","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"兼具特种部队般少数精锐的行动力，以及足以对抗正规军的军事力量。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0020A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"但也不算是假话。听说最近KGB成立了反破坏工作部门，好像叫<R=A,ALPHA>小组。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0020A0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"说到我们美国，有声名显赫的绿色贝雷帽、SEAL小队，还有你创立的FOXHOUND……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0025F0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你说得对。只要我们还是“无国界军队”，就会成为目标。我们需要威慑力量。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
